            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Client Connector › Edit Existing Profiles:** apply best-practice settings to the tenant's own forwarding profile and Windows app profile: the forwarding settings (Z-Tunnel 2.0, transparent redirect, drop IPv6 and more), the network and DNS switches, the IP, domain, VPN gateway and bypass lists, DNS settings and the logout, exit, uninstall and disable passwords. Review shows what's sent; there's no dry run or Undo, so note the current settings first. The change log lists each edit, and passwords are never saved.
]]></description>
